(c) the record of the provisionally attached property specified in sub-rule (6) of Rule 4 and the valuation report, if any, specified in sub-rule (8) of Rule 4;
(d) a list of the depositors from whom the deposit taker has accepted or collected deposits; and (e) a list of dues owed to depositors including amounts that may be realised from sale of any attached property of the deposit taker."
